# Second opinion

When a decision needs a second opinion, ask Claude Fable 5.2 and resume that session for the next question on the same topic:

`claude -p --model claude-fable-5-2 --resume <session-id>`

The alias is `fable`. Keep a topic's session id locally and pass it as `<session-id>`. Do not write a real session id in this file.

This rule is for Cursor only. Do not copy it into `AGENTS.md`; Claude Code reads that file.
